Reason: Moving Vegetation (port_vegetation.h): each model as it loads (J3DModelLoaderDataBase::load) has its leafy materials' display lists registered with the renderer, which sways them as it draws them (port_veg_model, ext/core/game/port_vegetation.cpp). Off, they are drawn as ever.

--- a/libs/JSystem/src/J3D/J3DGraphLoader/J3DModelLoader.cpp
